Applies the OpenBindings 0.2 specification working draft at
2f7d754dc2da374058cd517064c17e50f7d95d99.
The optional HTTP discovery companion is version 0.1.0 at that revision.
The implementation was informed by the Apache-2.0 Go SDK at
c5c6076fcf6bcf30a428c70c00bb4f3cbf6447df; it is not a source-identical port.

Third-party runtime/build dependency licenses and notices are reproduced in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and catalogued in DEPENDENCIES.json. The TypeScript
archive also includes the Rust standard library's attribution under licenses/.
The embedded JSON Schema 2020-12 meta-schema copies came from
https://github.com/santhosh-tekuri/jsonschema/tree/v6.0.3
and retain that package's Apache-2.0 license under schemas/ or licenses/.
The evaluator test-support fixture package preserves its JSON Schema Test Suite
MIT notice and Go SDK license beside the imported fixtures.
